# Secrets and Vercel CLI

**Doppler** (`pavilion` / `dev`) holds agent ops secrets (`VERCEL_TOKEN`, `VERCEL_ORG_ID`).  
**Vercel dashboard** holds Pavilion production runtime env.

Local `.env` is **bootstrap only**: `DOPPLER_TOKEN`. Never commit `.env`.

Before any `vercel` command:

```bash
./scripts/vercel-robert4220.sh … --scope robert-4220s-projects
```

Or `./scripts/doppler_run.sh env -u VERCEL_ORG_ID npx vercel … --scope robert-4220s-projects`

**Ship:** `node scripts/ship-pavilion.mjs --target commons-pto-demo` — see `pavilion-ship-deploy.mdc` and `~/shmspto/docs/AGENT-SHIP-MAP.md`.

Never treasurer / Stone Hill www. Stone Hill: `~/shmspto` → `node scripts/ship-stone-hill.mjs`.

`~/hskrg-work` uses the same Doppler project (`pavilion` / `dev`).
